  "notes": "Quillstack is a docs-site builder shown mid-setup for the elemental.nvim plugin. Distinctive: severity is carried consistently by colour across the whole UI — red/orange/blue count badges per nav page, matching coloured left rules and uppercase tag pills on issue cards, red header text 'Publish blocked…', and a disabled pale-blue Publish button. Each build issue card is a mini repair tool: a monospace source excerpt, a plain-language diagnosis, a 'Closest match' one-click fix chip, a select to repoint the reference, and 'Show line N in source' / help links. The Source/Split/Preview segmented control is dark-filled for the active option. The right panel's Page tab (not selected in the capture) holds a property inspector for page title, description and section anchors, and the Setup checklist header is a collapsible toggle (▾). Hairline borders, no shadows, light grey app background with white panels; the setup checklist's green check circles are the only filled icons."
